<title>USA: TABLE - Hercules Inc sells two-part deal.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Hercules Inc sells two-part deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche debt issue from Hercules Inc was priced on Wednesday, according to joint lead manager JP Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>NationsBanc Capital Markets Inc was the other joint manager.</p>
<p>Hercules Inc makes chemicals, related products, and solid fuel systems.</p>
<p>BORROWER HERCULES INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 6.15 PCT   MATURITY 8/1/2000</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.936  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD  6.174 PCT  PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD +35 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 6.60 PCT   MATURITY 8/1/2027</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.842  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD  6.622 PCT  PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD +57 BPS    CALLABLE  PUTABLE IN THE</p>
<p>						     10TH YEAR</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
